  The device has a contextual search app (Quire, config_defaultContextualSearchPackageName). Launcher3's
  ContextualSearchInvoker refuses to invoke contextual search without this feature; the name is AOSP's own
  (ContextualSearchManager.FEATURE_CONTEXTUAL_SEARCH).
-->
<permissions>
    <feature name="com.google.android.feature.CONTEXTUAL_SEARCH" />
</permissions>
